			"notes": "# Massive Rewrite\n## Command changes\nMost commands are shorten eg.  \n`/autolec listgoals` -> `/autolec list`  \n`/autolec addgoal` -> `/autolec add`\n`/autolec cleargoals` -> `/autolec clear`\n`/autolec itemsync` -> `/autolec sync item`\n## Goals change\nIf there are no goals, Auto Lectern will now cycle forever if you start it.  \nYou can add more specifiers to goals which include:\n`max/min/any/[from x to y] price`\n`max/min/any/[from x to y] level`\nIf no enchantment is specified in the add goal command,  \nALL available enchantments will be added to the goal list.  \n## Config\nGoals and settings like item sync will now be saved inside a toml file inside the config folder.  \n## Spoofing and slience\nYou can now look freely while using Auto Lectern due to the new look spoof feature.   \nThere will also be no villager GUI popups every few seconds like it was in the previous release due to the silent trade feature.   \nYou will no longer be locked in the same location in the Y axis to prevent accidentally triggering anti cheat."
		},
